flowchart TD
    Start[Caller dials masked number] --> Pre[Identification chain hits but two or more active tickets found]
    Pre --> A[IVR plays Ask for PIN audio]
    A --> Input{Caller input}
    Input -->|Enters a PIN| C{PIN valid and maps to an active ticket}
    Input -->|No PIN entered timeout| NoPin[Play No PIN entered audio]
    NoPin --> NoCount{Prompt count}
    NoCount -->|First or second timeout| A
    NoCount -->|Third timeout| EndNoPin[End call no PIN entered three times]
    C -->|YES| D[API 3 returns counterparty mobile]
    D --> E[Bridge to counterparty]
    E --> Done[Call connects]
    C -->|Wrong PIN| F[Play Wrong PIN audio]
    F --> Retry[IVR plays Ask for PIN audio one more time]
    Retry --> C2{Caller enters PIN}
    C2 -->|Correct PIN| D
    C2 -->|Wrong PIN second time| H[Play Limit reached and end call]

    classDef good fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class E,Done good
    class H,EndNoPin bad
